<programme start="20261118160000 +0000" stop="20261118190000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Stanford at Virginia Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Virginia Tech Hokies (6-3, 3-3 ACC) host the Stanford Cardinal (4-5, 2-4 ACC) at Lane Stadium. Quarterback Davis Warren leads Stanford with 14 touchdowns, while quarterback Ethan Grunkemeyer leads Virginia Tech with 18 touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
