<programme start="20261119065300 +0000" stop="20261119074900 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Six: To Hell</sub-title><desc lang="es">Eve asesina a Nathan por haber desfigurado a Symone, una de las prostitutas que trabajan para ella. Los hombres de Bronson encuentran a McCoy y Red Bill.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20220414</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/6e3c7cc863fef8521f67d703e99ba82b0ab65b2c.JPEG"/></programme>
