<programme start="20261118101800 +0000" stop="20261118110200 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">True Crime Story</title><sub-title lang="en">Citizen Detective: Rebekah Heath</sub-title><desc lang="en">A mystery that plagued law enforcement for over twenty years: four unidentified bodies found inside barrels in the woods; one woman searching for answers from her own troubled past sets herself on a journey to give the victims back their names.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20427808_b_v12_am.jpg"/></programme>
