<programme start="20261119031000 +0000" stop="20261119040000 +0000" channel="Film &amp; Arts 🇲🇽"><title lang="es">All Creatures Great and Small</title><sub-title lang="es">The Home Front</sub-title><desc lang="es">Helen se siente superflua en Skeldale, y la Sra. Hall se preocupa por Siegfried. Ambas mujeres descubren su verdadero lugar.</desc><date>20230101</date><category lang="es">Series</category><category lang="es">Series/Comedy</category><category lang="es">Culture/Knowledge</category><category lang="es">Series/Drama</category><category lang="es">Culture</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E06</episode-num><icon src="https://www.izzigo.tv/images/repository/020/21269020-SNAPSHOT-l.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261119040000 +0000" stop="20261119045500 +0000" channel="Film &amp; Arts 🇲🇽"><title lang="es">All Creatures Great and Small</title><sub-title lang="es">On a Wing and a Prayer: Christmas Special</sub-title><desc lang="es">Sin esperanza para el futuro, James anhela ver a Helen, pero un pájaro herido se interpone en su camino. Siegfried y Carmody intentan apoyar las iniciativas comunitarias de la Sra. Hall. Darrowby recibe a Carmody, quien disfruta de la experiencia.</desc><date>20230101</date><category lang="es">Series</category><category lang="es">Series/Comedy</category><category lang="es">Culture/Knowledge</category><category lang="es">Series/Drama</category><category lang="es">Culture</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E07</episode-num><icon src="https://www.izzigo.tv/images/repository/020/21269020-SNAPSHOT-l.jpg"/></programme>
