<programme start="20261119170000 +0000" stop="20261119190000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Colorado Avalanche at Utah Mammoth</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Utah Mammoth host the Colorado Avalanche in NHL regular-season play at the Delta Center in Salt Lake City. On a six-game losing run and sitting ninth in the Western Conference, Utah faces a Colorado team that is 12-6-3 and fourth in the West.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261119190000 +0000" stop="20261119210000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Boston Bruins at Detroit Red Wings</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Red Wings host the Bruins in NHL regular-season play at Little Caesars Arena. Detroit snapped a five-game skid with a 2-0 road win over Tampa Bay, but Boston have won three of the last five meetings between these Atlantic Division rivals.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
