<programme start="20261120022900 +0000" stop="20261120025800 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Magic City: An American Fantasy</title><sub-title lang="en">Whoomp! There It Is</sub-title><desc lang="en">Magic City became the epicenter of entertainment, drawing legendary celebrities before and during their rise to superstardom; the secret sauce was Mr. Magic&apos;s vision; he demanded that his club have the best of everything.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p30399539_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261120025800 +0000" stop="20261120032700 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Magic City: An American Fantasy</title><sub-title lang="en">Three, Six, Nine, Damn She Fine</sub-title><desc lang="en">With Mr. Magic in prison, the schemers play, Magic City spirals into lawlessness as DJs, bartenders and dancers ran their own side hustles; each believing they were bigger than the club.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p30399539_b_v12_ad.jpg"/></programme>
